SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790088864
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ANot all AI workers think the tech could
OL,4,Akill everyone
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Lol", "Haaaaaa" and "Bringing the
OL,7,Fluls" were among the reactions the BBC
OL,8,Freceived to a recent flurry of
OL,9,Fhigh-profile warnings by some people in
OL,10,Fthe industry.
OL,12,FWhile these fears go back decades,
OL,13,Fclaims made last week by Jacob Coxon, a
OL,14,Fformer Anthropic employee, went viral
OL,15,Fand were echoed by others in the sector
OL,16,Fwho urged a slowdown in development.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
